      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Chena_Ridge,_Alaska",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Chena Ridge grew as a residential enclave west of Fairbanks, perched on high ground overlooking the Tanana Valley.",
